Writes your topic's whole curriculum. Code checks it all at once and names every problem: subtopic titles unique; prerequisites naming subtopics of this curriculum, with no cycle; every tier's target_cards 5 to 25; its card types (prose, code, diagram, comparison, ascii; image stays 0 until photographs are sourced) summing to its target; and 5 to 10 grounding anchors a tier, each `<corpus path>#<exact ## heading>` of an ingested document of the topic's scope. Nothing is stored until it all passes; each call that passes is the curriculum's next version.
